<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="03">
<name>Transmission/Transaxle</name>
<section id="1001Y_S000S" variety="S000S">
<name>CVT</name>
<ttl id="1001Y_S000S_744HD_T007Y" variety="T007Y">
<name>CVT System [Super CVT-i] (K112/K112F)</name>
<para id="RM000003RBE009X" category="C" type-id="3007R" name-id="CV099-10" from="200912">
<dtccode>P0711/38</dtccode>
<dtcname>Fluid Temperature Sensor Circuit (Out of Range)</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000003RBE009X_01" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000I7R00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The fluid temperature sensor installed in the continuously variable transaxle assembly detects the fluid temperature in the transaxle hydraulic control circuit and outputs a signal corresponding to the fluid temperature to the engine control computer. The engine control computer estimates the CVT fluid temperature based on driving time, engine coolant temperature, intake air temperature, etc., and detects when the CVT fluid temperature sensor is out of range.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.06in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.19in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.83in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC NO.</ptxt>
<ptxt>SAE/TCCS</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Diagnosis Condition</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Abnormal Condition</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Malfunction Duration</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Others</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>P0711/38</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry>
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Engine coolant temperature and intake air temperature at engine start are -10°C or higher, and the vehicle is driven for 18 minutes and 8km or more</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>CVT fluid temperature (THO1) is less than 20°C</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>3 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>2 trip</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Continuously Variable Transaxle Assembly</ptxt>
<ptxt>(Fluid Temperature Sensor)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry>
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Engine coolant temperature at engine start is less than 35°C</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>CVT fluid temperature (THO1) is 100°C or higher</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>10 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>2 trip</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000003RBE009X_02" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000003RBE009X_03" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000003RBE009X_03_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000I7S00000">
<scantool type="1"/>
<testtitle>Check DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70201</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG ON.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display, read the DTCs.</ptxt>
<table>
<title>Result</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.30in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.83in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Only P0711/38 is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Codes other than P0711/38 are also output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000003RBE009X_03_0002" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM000003RBE009X_03_0006" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000003RBE009X_03_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___0000I7T00000">
<testtitle>Inspect CVT Fluid Level</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the CVT fluid level inspection procedure, refer to <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000020XT009X"/>.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000003RBE009X_03_0003" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000003RBE009X_03_0007" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000003RBE009X_03_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___0000I7U00000">
<testtitle>Replace Continuously Variable Transaxle Assembly</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt> For the continuously variable transaxle assembly replacement procedure, refer to <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000020TJ00AX"/>.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000003RBE009X_03_0004" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000003RBE009X_03_0004" proc-id="RM0550J___0000I7V00000">
<scantool type="1"/>
<testtitle>TaSCAN (A/T / CVT Learned Value Initialization, G Sensor 0-point Learning and CVT Hydraulic Pressure Learning)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70201</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<atten3>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Initializing the learned values clears both the G sensor 0 point learning and CVT hydraulic pressure learning values, so when replacing the parts in the table below, be sure to perform both G sensor 0 point learning and CVT hydraulic pressure learning after performing AT/CVT learned value initialization.</ptxt>
<table>
<tgroup cols="1">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="4.13in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry align="center">
<ptxt>Replacement Parts</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Continuously Variable Transaxle Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Engine Control Computer</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Oil Pressure Sensor</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Yaw Rate Sensor</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>After performing AT/CVT learned value initialization, be sure to perform G sensor 0-point learning first, and then CVT hydraulic pressure learning.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Be sure to place the vehicle on a level surface and perform 0 point learning.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Do not subject the vehicle to vibration while 0 point learning is in progress.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten3>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), perform A/T/CVT learned value initialization, G sensor 0 point learning and CVT hydraulic pressure learning. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000021F400AX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the DTCs again. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000000FSM00TX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000003RBE009X_03_0005" fin="true">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000003RBE009X_03_0005">
<testtitle>END</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000003RBE009X_03_0006">
<testtitle>Go to the relevant DTC<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000IZJ01JX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000003RBE009X_03_0007">
<testtitle>Inspect and Adjust CVT Fluid<xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000020XT009X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>